# DRIFTLINE: stage 3's boss. The moon that hung over the whole stage is an
# eye: the face around it shows itself, and only the eye can be hurt. Its
# hand takes turns: a five-way spread from the mouth, a fist that sweeps
# low along a wave (drive where it rides high), and a pass over the road
# that drops four snappers (a boss's chasers pay nothing). 30,000 points.
game driftline
wait 12
press A
cheat stage 3
cheat boss
waituntil boss_on == 1 10
expect boss_kind == 2
expect revealed == 0
waituntil revealed == 1 120
# the spread: five shots
cheat god
cheat pos 100
cheat attack 1
waituntil eshots == 5 40
wait 140
cheat clear
# the summons: four snappers
cheat attack 3
waituntil foes_11 == 4 200
cheat meter 700
cheat pos 160
hold UP 20
botuntil foes_11 == 0 1500
expect score == 0
cheat god
# the fist: where it rides low it takes the car; where it rides high, not
waituntil hand_state == 0 400
cheat pos 152
cheat attack 2
waituntil hand_state == 0 400
expect alive0 == 1
cheat pos 264
cheat attack 2
waituntil alive0 == 0 300
expect cause == 202
# shots at the face miss; the eye takes them
waituntil alive0 == 1 100
cheat god
cheat bossstill
cheat meter 700
cheat pos 280
hold UP 30
hold A 60
expect boss_hp == 800
cheat pos 236
hold A 60
expect boss_hp < 800
cheat bosshp 1
hold A
waituntil boss_dead == 1 60
release
expect score == 30000
